exit: 0
stdout:
{"reference":["  [--resources TEXT] [--label key=value ...] [--adapter none|kind|k3d|compose]","  [--file PATH (required for compose)] [--protect-live-owner] [--key K] [--pending [--name HANDLE]]","  [--quiet | -q] [--axi | --json]","Owner defaults to DIBS_OWNER, then pid:\u003cparent-pid\u003e. pid and session pin","process start time; session:\u003cholder-pid\u003e follows a session-holding process,","not a Unix SID. heartbeat:\u003cpath\u003e must already be a fresh regular file.","kind and k3d create uniquely named clusters; kind uses a private kubeconfig.","compose creates","a uniquely named project with a durable resolved config. none records metadata","only and performs no external cleanup. up is an alias.","--protect-live-owner: sweep never reclaims while the owner is alive or unknown,","even after expiry; only proven owner death reclaims. Use the worker's own owner.","Requires DIBS_LIVE_OWNER_PROTECTION=1 or \"live_owner_protection\": true.","--key K and --pending need the consumer contract (DIBS_CONSUMER_CONTRACT=1).","--key K: a retry with the same key and request returns status already_done.","With --pending or --key, --quiet prints only the lease ID (including on retry);","exit codes distinguish success from failure. --quiet cannot combine with --axi","or --json for those contract creates. Without these flags it keeps its usual behavior.","--pending records the lease before the caller creates a kind, k3d or Compose","resource in the selected Docker context; the caller then stamps the label","io.dibs.lease=\u003cid\u003e or uses the handle pinned with --name (which must not exist","yet), and runs dibs adopt \u003ctype\u003e \u003chandle\u003e --pending \u003cid\u003e. Release and sweep","of a pending lease bind its single match first, so a crash still reclaims.","Statuses: created, recorded, already_done.","Examples:","  dibs create --owner pid:1234 --ttl 2h --resources '2 CPUs, test lab'","  dibs create --adapter kind --owner session:1234 --ttl 1h","  dibs create --adapter compose --file compose.yaml --label task=lab","  dibs create --adapter kind --pending --name lab-7 --key task-7:lab --quiet","","Touch heartbeat files at most every staleness/3. Extend a lease at the latest","when one third of its TTL remains. Owner death OR expiry makes an unprotected","lease reclaimable, so its live owner can lose its resources by missing either","cadence. With --protect-live-owner, only proven owner death reclaims; a late","extend with a live owner reattaches when the resource is still present.","Output: --axi for agents, --json for scripts (mutually exclusive).","Default: human on terminals; AXI for pipes or DIBS_AXI=1.","Lease commands: --full restores complete AXI records/text; JSON is always complete.","","Consumer contract 1 is off until DIBS_CONSUMER_CONTRACT=1 or \"consumer_contract\":","true in the user config. While off, reconcile, reclaim, explain, --pending and","--key exit 2 naming the setting, and extend and release behave as described above.","While on, these commands and extend and release follow contract 1:","exit 0 success with status; 1 operation failed, records retained; 2 usage;","3 refusal, nothing changed, with a stable reason: not_found, wrong_machine,","not_pending, already_leased, key_conflict, handle_exists, handle_mismatch,","resource_absent, resource_unknown, ambiguous, owner_alive, owner_unknown,","expired, owner_dead, job_deadline. Extend success is renewed or reattached.","Exit 1 is only for operation failures. Output carries contract: 1.","See docs/consumer-contract.md.","","Exit codes: 0 success (including no-ops), 1 operation failed, 2 invalid usage.","dibs job: child's exit code on completion; 124 deadline killed child;","75 (EX_TEMPFAIL) no slot within wait. Dibs's own 1/2 apply only when no child","was started. Signal termination returns 128 + signal number. Helper/wait","failures after start use 125/126 and diagnostics on stderr.","76 is SSH transport/protocol failure with unknown remote result (stderr).","Child exit 255 is preserved and is not confused with SSH failure."],"usage":"dibs create [--owner KIND:ID] [--ttl 8h] [--stale 15m]"}
